G W 0~
king snurre fire giant king~
King Snurre~
A fire giant of titanic proportions rises from his throne in anger!
~
   Orange, tusklike teeth protrude from the grinning maw of this ugly monarch,
his face covered in bright red bristles as tough as iron.  Immensely powerful
muscles ripple beneath the black iron plate that covers his scarred torso, and
his huge fists clench a flaming sword as long as a tall man.  Fabulous gems
glitter in his iron crown, which covers most of his massive head.  This fellow
appears powerful, but hardly a tactical genius.  Surely he cannot be the power
behind the troubles?    
~
